l/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T16:38:57-07:00","id":1461434,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">If spirits naturally resistant to werewolves are haughty little jerks, silver spirits are the haughtiest of them all. They congregate around mines and jewelers\u2019 workshops, preening over their metallic, twisting forms. They aren\u2019t immune to the Uratha, but it hurts like hell to bite them. Modern Bone Shadow and Iron Masters prefer engaging them at range with sniper rifles and shotguns, but the silver </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>ilthum</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> still has a chip on its shoulder.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The King of Silver is a massive owl made of delicate silver filigree with three heads and nine wings. While it is not impaired in any way by the loss, its eyes are missing and its sockets ooze acanthite sludge. What this says about the exact relationship between the King and Hathis-Ur\u2019s silver-eyed owls is unclear. Much like Luna, the King is mercurial and ever-changing, but its patterns are more difficult to predict than Father Moon\u2019s phases.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">While the King remains wary werewolves, it will occasionally aid packs bold enough to approach it. The Ivory Claws seek out the King and its brood for their sadomasochistic experiments, using silver essence as a purifying scourge. The Iron Masters also receive a greater degree of tolerance than the rest of the People. The King has a great love for humanity, who refine silver from base ores and worship it with their crafts. Without humans, it would never have become an Incarna. The King respects the </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Farsil Luhal</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> for honouring humanity as their Sacred Prey in the hunt.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The King of Silver is a master of dozens of rites, driving werewolf packs to seek it out as a mentor. It is well known as a fetish-crafter, but it also knows many more obscure rituals. It doesn\u2019t seek out to humiliate packs pursuing its knowledge but does test their boundaries. It is rumoured that the King served as the totem for at least two packs - one </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Urdaga</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> and one </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Anshega</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> - but these stories never end well for the werewolves involved.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The King of Silver</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Rank 5 Silver Spirit </i></span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Attributes:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Power 15 Finesse 15 Resistance 11</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Willpower:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">10</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Initiative:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> +26</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Defence:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">15</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Speed:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">40</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Size:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> 10</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Corpus:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">36 </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Influences:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Silver 3, Wealth 2</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Numina:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Awe, Blast, Drain, Entropic Decay, Mortal Mask, Regenerate, Seek, Speed, Silver Blessing, Silver Smith, Wolfsbane</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Manifestations:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Twilight Form, Discorporiate, Gauntlet Breach, Image, Materialize, Possess </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Ban:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The King of Silver must grant a boon to anyone who crafts 99 silver objects by hand in one month. </span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Bane:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Sulfur taken from a volcano that erupted with the last 24 hours. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>New Numan - Silver Smith: </i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">When crafting Fetishes from spirits of wealth or metal, the King of Silver receives 8-again. If the spirit is also a silver spirit, it achieves an exceptional success on three successes. By spending five Essence, the King bestows this benefit on a werewolf as a Condition that resolves when the boon is used. By spending three Essence, the King can perceive the environment around any Fetish it helped craft. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>New Numan - Silver Blessing: </i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">By spending a Willpower, the King can bestow the Inspired Condition on a willing target. While the Condition lasts, silver coins appear out of nowhere as the subject needs them, granting two additional dots of resources.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>New Numan - Wolfsbane:</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Werewolves (and other creatures with sliver as a Bane) suffer a -5 Penalty in Clash of Wills and contested rolls against the King. </span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":4433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 09-25-2021, 09:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-25T18:18:59-07:00","id":1461454,"title":"","content":"I think you meant \u201cone urdaga and one anshega\u201d in the last sentence of t